    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXON is fast, violent, and unrelenting. You'll need to master every weapon, power, and movement tool at your disposal to survive the onslaught. Precision and aggression are your only lifelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/e7ef084baf7d2bd5d08360c78f0b55c5.webp?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/3c1b9b247d6ab19f873cbb9f1e8b5704.poster.avif?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/3c1b9b247d6ab19f873cbb9f1e8b5704.webm?t=1755068213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/e7ef084baf7d2bd5d08360c78f0b55c5.webp?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies conjure storms of forbidden power and strike with brutal, unholy force. Every encounter is a deadly clash of brutality and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/e7ef084baf7d2bd5d08360c78f0b55c5.webp?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/f0156f57b650de888db4feec7f55fbdf.poster.avif?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/f0156f57b650de888db4feec7f55fbdf.webm?t=1755068213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/e7ef084baf7d2bd5d08360c78f0b55c5.webp?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt or perish. Learn to command your arsenal, unleash devastating abilities, and use the environment to your advantage. Victory isn\u2019t given - it\u2019s taken by force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/e7ef084baf7d2bd5d08360c78f0b55c5.webp?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=60 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/26526fb5f196a026e298646e9f19754a.poster.avif?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/26526fb5f196a026e298646e9f19754a.webm?t=1755068213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/e7ef084baf7d2bd5d08360c78f0b55c5.webp?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augment your body and bend the battlefield to your will. Each enhancement fuels your rampage, turning you into the apex predator of this broken world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXON is fast, violent, and unrelenting. You'll need to master every weapon, power, and movement tool at your disposal to survive the onslaught. Precision and aggression are your only lifelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/e7ef084baf7d2bd5d08360c78f0b55c5.webp?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/3c1b9b247d6ab19f873cbb9f1e8b5704.poster.avif?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/3c1b9b247d6ab19f873cbb9f1e8b5704.webm?t=1755068213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/e7ef084baf7d2bd5d08360c78f0b55c5.webp?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies conjure storms of forbidden power and strike with brutal, unholy force. Every encounter is a deadly clash of brutality and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/e7ef084baf7d2bd5d08360c78f0b55c5.webp?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/f0156f57b650de888db4feec7f55fbdf.poster.avif?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/f0156f57b650de888db4feec7f55fbdf.webm?t=1755068213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/e7ef084baf7d2bd5d08360c78f0b55c5.webp?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt or perish. Learn to command your arsenal, unleash devastating abilities, and use the environment to your advantage. Victory isn\u2019t given - it\u2019s taken by force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/e7ef084baf7d2bd5d08360c78f0b55c5.webp?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=60 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/26526fb5f196a026e298646e9f19754a.poster.avif?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/26526fb5f196a026e298646e9f19754a.webm?t=1755068213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/e7ef084baf7d2bd5d08360c78f0b55c5.webp?t=1755068213\" width=550 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augment your body and bend the battlefield to your will. Each enhancement fuels your rampage, turning you into the apex predator of this broken world.</p>",
